      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how heavy and isolating that feeling can be when you feel invisible even in a crowded crowd. It might help to try a small action that could break the numbness, like smiling at a person or just holding an empty calm in your hands. You are not a ghost in your own life, and taking one slow step can help make that connection again.",
      "source": "target",
